  displayName: A Wall Round Nothing
  description: 'Palisades burn and huts are cramped: the haven has outgrown wood. A mason has been seen in the deep woods, building walls round nothing at all. Bring her home.'
  chain: The Lost Expedition
  journalNotes: Nobody knows what Hild was walling in, or out. She is a mason, not one of the expedition, and she builds in stone while everyone else builds in wood.
